functions, a boolean prop from another copy comes out as `open=\"true\"`. So core now records each prop's kind (`boolean`, `json` and so on) itself.\n\n**Effects for the next tickets:**\n- The ADR states the breaking change: code that calls `El.render` directly, without a templater, must import `microtags/render-support` once.\n- It also says the hydration example still ships the support module, because it keeps Badge and Notice.\n- The browser templater will go over its 4.6 kB limit and needs raising under the spec's rule.\n- The suggested core budget is 3.95 kB; ticket 13 sets the final number.\n- If the record core passes to the support module changes shape, the hook's key has to change too.\n- ADR-005 itself is not edited yet; ticket 13 adds its note.\n\nI also added a short note to `AGENTS.md`: `npm run lint` covers `.scratch/**/*.ts`, and it explains how to measure a core change in a temp copy. My notes are in `.nightralph/notes.md` (not committed).","ttft_ms":2828,"type":"result","duration_ms":337653,"uuid":"1a1aeaaa-408a-47a1-a79e-9f0961c346ad","ttft_stream_ms":1665,"time_to_request_ms":56,"first_content_frame_ms":1665,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
